codex
Two residual gaps are visible in the code review: the proxy budget is detached when the production bridge takes over (and no outbound budget exists), and the font probe still treats `document.fonts.check(...) === true` as proof that the chosen font contains the CJK glyph. I’m running the focused suites now to separate passing tests from requirement coverage.
